{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"# 🤖 ROBOTICS — MASTER ROADMAP\n\n### The destination\n**CSE + ECE + ME → Robotics → Autonomy → Real Robot**\n\n### How to use this Canvas\n- 🟢 **Foundation** — learn first\n- 🟡 **Core** — robotics fundamentals\n- 🟠 **Integration** — connect disciplines\n- 🔴 **Advanced** — specialize\n- ☐ Check items off as you gain working competence\n\n**Rule:** Every major block should end with a project.","x":0,"y":0,"width":560,"height":440,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"phase1","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 PHASE 1 — FOUNDATION\n\n☐ Python — P0\n☐ C — P0\n☐ Linux + Bash — P0\n☐ Git / GitHub — P0\n☐ Linear Algebra — P0\n☐ Calculus — P0\n☐ Basic electronics — P0\n☐ Engineering mechanics — P0\n\n**Build:** CLI tools + small C programs + simple electronics experiments","x":-1240,"y":10,"width":430,"height":390,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"phase2","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 PHASE 2 — PHYSICAL COMPUTING\n\n☐ Embedded C — P0\n☐ ESP32 / STM32 — P0\n☐ GPIO / PWM / ADC / timers\n☐ Interrupts / DMA\n☐ UART / SPI / I²C\n☐ CAN — P0\n☐ Sensors\n☐ Motors + drivers\n☐ CAD basics\n\n**Build:** encoder motor controller + IMU logger","x":-810,"y":-760,"width":430,"height":480,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"# 🧭 TRACKING LEGEND\n\n☐ Not started  \n◐ Learning  \n◑ Can use with guidance  \n☑ Can build independently  \n★ Deep specialization\n\n### Priority\n**P0** = mandatory  \n**P1** = important  \n**P2** = specialization\n\n### T-shaped goal\nBroad competence across CSE/ECE/ME + deep expertise in **one or two robotics areas**.","x":1765,"y":-560,"width":670,"height":560,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"phase3","type":"text","text":"# 🟡 PHASE 3 — ROBOTICS CORE\n\n☐ Coordinate frames\n☐ Homogeneous transforms\n☐ DH parameters\n☐ Forward kinematics\n☐ Inverse kinematics\n☐ Jacobian\n☐ Singularities\n☐ Workspace\n☐ Robot dynamics\n\n**Build:** 2/3-link arm simulator → 6-DOF model","x":-80,"y":-860,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"phase4","type":"text","text":"# 🟡 PHASE 4 — CONTROL + SIMULATION\n\n☐ Feedback systems\n☐ PID\n☐ State-space\n☐ Stability\n☐ LQR\n☐ Kalman filter\n☐ NumPy / SciPy\n☐ PyBullet\n☐ Gazebo\n\n**Build:** PID-controlled robot + simulated mobile robot","x":640,"y":-640,"width":430,"height":420,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"phase5","type":"text","text":"# 🟠 PHASE 5 — ROS 2\n\n☐ Linux robotics workflow\n☐ C++ + CMake\n☐ ROS 2 nodes\n☐ Topics / services / actions\n☐ Parameters / launch\n☐ TF2\n☐ QoS\n☐ RViz\n☐ rosbag\n☐ URDF / Xacro\n☐ ros2_control\n\n**Build:** complete ROS 2 robot in simulation","x":920,"y":10,"width":430,"height":340,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"phase6","type":"text","text":"# 🟠 PHASE 6 — AUTONOMY\n\nChoose a primary track:\n\n### Navigation\n☐ Nav2\n☐ Localization\n☐ SLAM\n☐ Path planning\n\n### Manipulation\n☐ MoveIt 2\n☐ IK solvers\n☐ Motion planning\n☐ Grasping\n\nThen add:\n☐ Computer vision\n☐ Sensor fusion","x":1440,"y":600,"width":430,"height":340,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"phase7","type":"text","text":"# 🔴 PHASE 7 — ADVANCED\n\n☐ MPC\n☐ Nonlinear control\n☐ Advanced SLAM\n☐ 3D perception\n☐ Deep learning\n☐ Reinforcement learning\n☐ Imitation learning\n☐ Real-time systems\n☐ FPGA acceleration\n☐ Sim-to-real\n\n**Specialize:** manipulation / mobile / legged / humanoid / aerial / autonomous vehicles","x":1920,"y":1265,"width":430,"height":570,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"kin","type":"text","text":"# 🤖 KINEMATICS — P0\n\n☐ Frames & transforms\n☐ DH convention\n☐ Forward kinematics\n☐ Inverse kinematics\n☐ Jacobian\n☐ Velocity kinematics\n☐ Singularities\n☐ Workspace\n☐ Quaternions\n☐ Redundant manipulators\n\n**Project:** FK/IK/Jacobian visualizer","x":-3440,"y":1475,"width":390,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"planning","type":"text","text":"# 🧭 PLANNING — P1\n\n☐ Configuration space\n☐ Collision checking\n☐ A*\n☐ Dijkstra\n☐ RRT / RRT*\n☐ PRM\n☐ Splines\n☐ Polynomial trajectories\n☐ Velocity / acceleration limits\n\n**Project:** obstacle-aware arm/mobile planner","x":-3830,"y":2138,"width":390,"height":402,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"advanced","type":"text","text":"# 🚀 ADVANCED SPECIALIZATIONS — P2\n\nChoose **1–2** after core competence.\n\n☐ Manipulation\n☐ Mobile robotics\n☐ Legged robotics\n☐ Humanoids\n☐ Drones\n☐ Autonomous vehicles\n☐ MPC / optimal control\n☐ Nonlinear control\n☐ Advanced SLAM\n☐ 3D perception\n☐ Robot learning\n☐ Reinforcement learning\n☐ Imitation learning\n☐ FPGA acceleration\n☐ Real-time robotics\n☐ Multi-agent robotics","x":-1650,"y":5680,"width":500,"height":560,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cse","type":"text","text":"# 💻 CSE — SOFTWARE\n\n### Languages\n☐ Python — ★★★★★\n☐ C — ★★★★☆\n☐ C++ — ★★★★★\n\n### Systems\n☐ Linux\n☐ Bash\n☐ Git\n☐ CMake\n☐ Docker\n☐ GDB\n☐ Networking\n☐ Concurrency\n\n### Libraries\n☐ NumPy\n☐ SciPy\n☐ Matplotlib\n☐ SymPy\n☐ OpenCV\n☐ PyTorch\n\n### Robotics\n☐ rclpy\n☐ rclcpp\n☐ ROS 2","x":-2000,"y":880,"width":355,"height":860,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"ece","type":"text","text":"# ⚡ ECE — EMBEDDED\n\n### Electronics\n☐ Circuit theory\n☐ Digital logic\n☐ ADC / DAC\n☐ MOSFETs\n☐ Regulators\n\n### MCU\n☐ ESP32\n☐ STM32\n☐ Embedded C\n☐ GPIO / PWM\n☐ Timers\n☐ Interrupts\n☐ DMA\n\n### Communication\n☐ UART\n☐ SPI\n☐ I²C\n☐ CAN / CAN-FD\n☐ Ethernet\n\n### Real-time\n☐ FreeRTOS\n☐ Tasks / queues / mutexes\n\n### Optional\n☐ PCB design\n☐ FPGA\n☐ Verilog / SystemVerilog","x":-1415,"y":995,"width":390,"height":1005,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"me","type":"text","text":"# ⚙️ ME — ROBOT HARDWARE\n\n### Mechanics\n☐ Engineering mechanics\n☐ Rigid-body dynamics\n☐ Machine design\n\n### CAD\n☐ SolidWorks / Fusion / Onshape\n☐ Parts\n☐ Assemblies\n☐ Constraints\n☐ Drawings\n\n### Mechanical components\n☐ Gears\n☐ Bearings\n☐ Shafts\n☐ Couplings\n☐ Belts / chains\n\n### Robot hardware\n☐ Links / joints\n☐ Actuators\n☐ Transmissions\n☐ End effectors\n☐ Friction / backlash\n☐ Stiffness / payload\n\n### Manufacturing\n☐ Tolerances\n☐ 3D printing\n☐ Machining\n☐ DFM / DFA","x":-805,"y":1120,"width":390,"height":1040,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"perception","type":"text","text":"# 👁️ PERCEPTION — P1\n\n### Classical vision\n☐ OpenCV\n☐ Calibration\n☐ Filtering\n☐ Features\n☐ Homography\n\n### 3D\n☐ Stereo\n☐ Depth\n☐ Point clouds\n☐ ICP\n\n### AI\n☐ Detection\n☐ Segmentation\n☐ Pose estimation","x":-2960,"y":1835,"width":390,"height":605,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"est","type":"text","text":"# 📡 ESTIMATION — P1\n\n☐ Odometry\n☐ Noise models\n☐ Covariance\n☐ Kalman filter\n☐ EKF / UKF\n☐ Particle filter\n☐ Sensor fusion\n☐ State estimation\n\n**Project:** fuse encoder + IMU data","x":-2685,"y":3250,"width":390,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ros","type":"text","text":"# 🟦 ROS 2 — P0 FOR ROBOT SOFTWARE\n\n### Core\n☐ Nodes\n☐ Topics\n☐ Services\n☐ Actions\n☐ Parameters\n☐ Launch\n☐ QoS\n\n### Tools\n☐ TF2\n☐ RViz\n☐ rosbag\n☐ colcon\n☐ rosdep\n\n### Integration\n☐ rclcpp\n☐ rclpy\n☐ URDF / Xacro\n☐ ros2_control\n\n**Project:** complete simulated robot stack","x":-4320,"y":4540,"width":490,"height":900,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"control","type":"text","text":"# 🎛️ CONTROL — P0\n\n☐ Feedback\n☐ PID\n☐ Transfer functions\n☐ State-space\n☐ Stability\n☐ Controllability\n☐ Observability\n☐ Pole placement\n☐ LQR\n\n### Advanced\n☐ MPC\n☐ Nonlinear control\n☐ Adaptive control\n\n**Project:** real motor PID controller","x":-2685,"y":2535,"width":390,"height":535,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"projects","type":"text","text":"# 🛠️ PROJECT LADDER — PORTFOLIO\n\n☐ 01 — 3-link planar arm\n☐ 02 — FK / IK visualizer\n☐ 03 — Jacobian / singularity tool\n☐ 04 — PID simulation\n☐ 05 — Encoder motor controller\n☐ 06 — IMU logger + sensor fusion\n☐ 07 — Self-balancing robot\n☐ 08 — ROS 2 robot\n☐ 09 — URDF + Gazebo robot\n☐ 10 — Nav2 autonomous robot\n☐ 11 — SLAM robot\n☐ 12 — 6-DOF arm + MoveIt 2\n☐ 13 — Vision-guided manipulation\n☐ 14 — Sim-to-real autonomous robot\n\n**Portfolio rule:** each project must integrate at least 2 domains.","x":-400,"y":5120,"width":500,"height":480,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# 🚗 AUTONOMOUS NAVIGATION — P1\n\n☐ Differential drive\n☐ Odometry\n☐ Localization\n☐ SLAM\n☐ AMCL\n☐ Nav2\n☐ Global planning\n☐ Local planning\n☐ Obstacle avoidance\n☐ Recovery behaviors\n\n**Project:** autonomous mobile robot","x":-3210,"y":5120,"width":500,"height":440,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"manip","type":"text","text":"# 🦾 MANIPULATION — P1\n\n☐ MoveIt 2\n☐ IK solvers\n☐ Collision checking\n☐ Motion planning\n☐ Trajectory execution\n☐ Grasping\n☐ End-effector control\n☐ Force / torque control\n\n**Project:** vision-guided pick-and-place","x":-3245,"y":4240,"width":535,"height":595,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"sim","type":"text","text":"# 🧪 SIMULATION STACK — P0 → P1\n\n### Start\n☐ NumPy\n☐ Matplotlib\n☐ SymPy\n\n### Physics\n☐ PyBullet\n\n### Robotics simulation\n☐ Gazebo / Gazebo Harmonic\n☐ URDF\n☐ SDF\n\n### Advanced\n☐ Isaac Sim\n☐ USD\n\n**Workflow:**\nModel → simulate → control → validate → deploy","x":-3920,"y":3420,"width":430,"height":710,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"systems","type":"text","text":"# 🏗️ SYSTEMS ENGINEERING — P0\n\n☐ Requirements\n☐ Architecture\n☐ Interfaces\n☐ Timing / latency\n☐ Reliability\n☐ Fault handling\n☐ Safety limits\n☐ Calibration\n☐ Testing\n☐ Logging / observability\n\n### Validation ladder\nSimulation\n→ HIL\n→ Bench\n→ Controlled environment\n→ Real robot\n→ Autonomous deployment","x":-3185,"y":5940,"width":500,"height":600,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"embeddedloop","type":"text","text":"# 🔌 EMBEDDED ↔ ROS — P0\n\nROS 2\n↓\nros2_control / custom node\n↓\nUSB / UART / CAN / Ethernet\n↓\nMCU\n↓\nMotor driver\n↓\nMotor / actuator\n↓\nEncoder / IMU / sensors\n↓\nROS 2\n\n**Goal:** understand the entire loop, not just ROS.","x":-1875,"y":4715,"width":450,"height":550,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"dyn","type":"text","text":"# ⚙️ DYNAMICS — P0\n\n☐ Newton-Euler\n☐ Lagrangian mechanics\n☐ Mass matrix M(q)\n☐ Coriolis / centrifugal terms\n☐ Gravity\n☐ Friction\n☐ Actuator torque\n\n**Target model:**\nM(q)q̈ + C(q,q̇)q̇ + g(q) = τ\n\n**Project:** dynamic arm simulation","x":-805,"y":2440,"width":390,"height":550,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"math","type":"text","text":"# 🧮 MATHEMATICS — P0\n\n### Foundation\n☐ Linear algebra\n☐ Calculus\n☐ Differential equations\n☐ Probability & statistics\n\n### Robotics math\n☐ Least squares\n☐ Optimization\n☐ Numerical methods\n☐ Rotation matrices\n☐ Quaternions\n☐ SO(3) / SE(3)\n\n### Advanced\n☐ Lie groups\n☐ Optimal control math\n☐ State estimation","x":-2765,"y":683,"width":390,"height":625,"color":"1"}
	],
